WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:19.355
"You're mean, Zippy," said Dipper.

2
00:00:19.356 --> 00:00:22.662
"Eddy is fast," said Jeb.

3
00:00:22.663 --> 00:00:27.210
"He won our race," said Poppy.

4
00:00:27.211 --> 00:00:31.216
"Eddy is not fast," said Zippy.

5
00:00:31.217 --> 00:00:37.552
"He won because you're all slow!"

6
00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:40.293
Eddy felt sad.

7
00:00:40.294 --> 00:00:43.542
"I'm fast!" said Zippy.

8
00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:46.720
He zoomed off.

9
00:00:46.721 --> 00:00:50.702
Vroom! Vroom!

10
00:00:50.703 --> 00:00:53.138
Zippy turned left.

11
00:00:53.139 --> 00:00:55.417
He turned right.

12
00:00:55.418 --> 00:01:09.144
"Wow," thought Eddy.

13
00:01:09.145 --> 00:01:12.360
Crash!

14
00:01:12.361 --> 00:01:19.430
Zippy hit a wall.

15
00:01:19.431 --> 00:01:22.926
Something rolled across the lot.

16
00:01:22.927 --> 00:01:26.132
"My wheel!" cried Zippy.

17
00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:28.829
"I can't drive now!"

18
00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:36.130
Zippy looked sad.

19
00:01:36.131 --> 00:01:39.933
"I'll help," said Eddy.

20
00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:47.130
"Me too," said Jeb.

21
00:01:47.131 --> 00:01:49.889
Jeb picked up Zippy's wheel.

22
00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:52.048
He put it in Eddy's dumper.

23
00:01:52.049 --> 00:02:03.888
Eddy carried the wheel to Zippy.

24
00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:07.812
"Thanks," said Zippy.

25
00:02:07.813 --> 00:02:12.148
"Eddy, let's race again!" called Poppy.

26
00:02:12.149 --> 00:02:13.846
Eddy smiled.

27
00:02:13.847 --> 00:02:17.381
Zippy was mean.

28
00:02:17.382 --> 00:02:25.281
But Eddy had three new friends!
